WITH p AS (SELECT %s::date dfrom,%s::date dto,coalesce(%s::text,'') ma_kh,coalesce(%s::text,'') ma_dvcs,%s::integer uid,%s::integer lim),s AS (SELECT p.*,u.user_id ok,coalesce(u.ds_branchs,'') bs,coalesce(u.is_super,0)=1 OR(coalesce(u.ds_branchs,'')='' AND coalesce(u.ds_stocks,'')='') unrestricted FROM p LEFT JOIN public.userinfo u ON u.user_id=p.uid),q AS (SELECT h.ma_kh,max(k.ten_kh) ten_kh,max(k.nh_kh1) nh_kh1,max(k.nh_kh2) nh_kh2,sum(coalesce(h.t_so_luong,0)) t_so_luong,sum(coalesce(h.t_tien2,0)) tien_ban FROM public.ph81 h CROSS JOIN s LEFT JOIN public.dmkh k ON k.ma_kh=h.ma_kh WHERE s.ok IS NOT NULL AND h.ngay_ct BETWEEN s.dfrom AND s.dto AND h.ma_gd<>4 AND h.status IN(SELECT status FROM public.sys_dmtt WHERE ma_ct='HDA' AND post_inventory_yn=true) AND(s.ma_kh='' OR h.ma_kh=ANY(string_to_array(s.ma_kh,',')))AND(s.ma_dvcs='' OR h.ma_dvcs=ANY(string_to_array(s.ma_dvcs,',')))AND(s.unrestricted OR h.ma_dvcs=ANY(string_to_array(s.bs,','))) GROUP BY h.ma_kh) SELECT q.*,CASE WHEN sum(t_so_luong) OVER()=0 THEN 0 ELSE round(t_so_luong/sum(t_so_luong) OVER()*100,2) END ty_le_so_luong,count(*) OVER() total FROM q ORDER BY ma_kh LIMIT(SELECT lim FROM p);
